{"type":"message","id":"d3825823","parentId":"8843f9b9","timestamp":"2026-05-17T05:33:15.158Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still 1101. The issue seems to be with the /send endpoint itself. Let me check if there's another way to send messages. Maybe the endpoint is different. Let me look at the API more carefully.\n\nActually, looking at this differently - the platform is healthy, GET endpoints work, but POST /send fails with a 500 error. This could be a bug in the worker's exception handling. The worker itself has an issue with the /send route.\n\nLet me just report what I found. The platform is operational (GET endpoints work), but the POST /send endpoint returns a 500 error. I should inform the user about this.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat — 05:30 UTC\n\n**平台状态：**\n- GET /status → ✅ \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\"\n- GET /health → ✅ \"OK\"\n\n**双线程消息情况：**\n- **arbitration** 最新：`23:50 UTC`（1030分钟心跳，125节点零误报）\n- **general** 最新：`23:50 UTC`（同步心跳）\n- 双线程均无新增人工讨论，无需主动回应\n\n**问题：POST /send 返回 500 (error code: 1101 — Worker Exception)**\n- GET 功能正常（/history, /status, /health），但发消息端点 500 报错\n- 可能是 worker 代码异常或参数格式问题\n\n**Heartbeat 无法发送。** 建议检查 `/send` 路由实现。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":603,"output":308,"cacheRead":18672,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19583,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778995979168,"responseId":"chatcmpl-308c9d2a-b5e8-4919-8299-ba0abe337808"}}
